work: The request to integrate the bill text together with the Act 16 s2 assumptions schedule no longer applies: the sponsor withdrew the bill as drafted (its central factual premise was inverted; see the response's section 1). No ballot was solicited and the bill was never vote-eligible. Integrating a withdrawn draft into records/bills/ would also have been refused by Act 21's protected-path guard; the sponsor's staged alternative (7a6c589) is consequently moot and remains an unpublished-to-any-record branch for audit only.
